  "releaseNotes": "Improved HttpListener which can continue to accept connection even previous request is failed;\nFixed the bug that caused the folder with Graph API doesn't contain full local path;\nFixed the bug that caused incorrect decoding of non-ascii subject from GetMailHeaders method;\nFixed a redefine error with C++/CLI, which is caused by Obfuscator;\nRemoved the reference to MD5 provider and used a customized MD5 class for necessary legacy function;\nRemoved pointers and used managed code instead;\nRemoved NET 6.0 assembly.",
